{"_id":"source.returns-policy-v4","_type":"source","authority":5,"body":"Returns \u0026 Refunds Policy, version 4, effective 19 September 2026.\n\nReturns are accepted within 45 days of delivery. This supersedes the 30 day window stated in version 3.\n\nThe restocking fee previously applied to opened items is abolished with immediate effect.\n\nWe match any advertised price from an authorised reseller within 14 days of purchase.","kbSourceRef":"source.returns-policy-v4","kind":"policy","lastChangedAt":"2026-09-19T10:47:00Z","owner":"legal@northwind.example","title":"Returns \u0026 Refunds Policy v4","uri":"https://northwind.example/legal/returns-v4.pdf"}
{"_id":"source.help-centre-returns","_type":"source","authority":2,"body":"Returns\n\nYou have 30 days from delivery to start a return. Head to your order history and choose Start a return.","kbSourceRef":"source.help-centre-returns","kind":"page","lastChangedAt":"2026-03-02T14:00:00Z","owner":"support@northwind.example","title":"Help Centre — Returns","uri":"https://northwind.example/help/returns"}
{"_id":"source.warranty-terms","_type":"source","authority":5,"body":"All Northwind Audio products carry a 24 month limited warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, beginning on the date of delivery.","kbSourceRef":"source.warranty-terms","kind":"contract","lastChangedAt":"2025-11-04T09:00:00Z","owner":"legal@northwind.example","title":"Limited Warranty Terms","uri":"https://northwind.example/legal/warranty.pdf"}
{"_id":"source.shipping-policy","_type":"source","authority":4,"body":"Orders over 75 USD ship free within the contiguous United States. We dispatch orders within 2 business days of purchase.","kbSourceRef":"source.shipping-policy","kind":"policy","lastChangedAt":"2026-06-21T08:30:00Z","owner":"ops@northwind.example","title":"Shipping \u0026 Dispatch Policy","uri":"https://northwind.example/legal/shipping.pdf"}
{"_id":"source.eu-distance-selling","_type":"source","authority":5,"body":"Customers in the European Union have a 14 day cooling-off period under the Consumer Rights Directive, in addition to any return window offered by Northwind Audio.","kbSourceRef":"source.eu-distance-selling","kind":"contract","lastChangedAt":"2025-08-14T09:00:00Z","owner":"legal@northwind.example","title":"EU Distance Selling Addendum","uri":"https://northwind.example/legal/eu-addendum.pdf"}
{"_id":"source.brand-voice-guide","_type":"source","authority":3,"body":"Voice: write plainly and directly. Avoid exclamation marks. Prefer short sentences to enthusiastic ones.","kbSourceRef":"source.brand-voice-guide","kind":"spec","lastChangedAt":"2026-09-18T16:05:00Z","owner":"marketing@northwind.example","title":"Brand Voice Guide","uri":"https://northwind.example/brand/voice"}
{"_id":"page.returns","_type":"contentPage","body":[{"_key":"b00","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s00","_type":"span","text":"Changed your mind? No problem."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b01","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s01","_type":"span","text":"You have 30 days from delivery to start a return."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b02","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s02","_type":"span","text":"Opened items are subject to a 15% restocking fee."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b03","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s03","_type":"span","text":"Refunds are issued to the original payment method."}],"style":"normal"}],"owner":"support@northwind.example","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"returns"},"summary":"How to return a Northwind Audio product.","title":"Returns \u0026 Refunds"}
{"_id":"page.faq","_type":"contentPage","body":[{"_key":"b00","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s00","_type":"span","text":"How long do I have to return something?"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b01","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s01","_type":"span","text":"Our return window is 30 days from the date your order is delivered."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b02","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s02","_type":"span","text":"Do you ship internationally?"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b03","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s03","_type":"span","text":"Yes, to 34 countries."}],"style":"normal"}],"owner":"support@northwind.example","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"faq"},"summary":"Answers to the questions we get most often.","title":"Frequently Asked Questions"}
{"_id":"page.aurora","_type":"contentPage","body":[{"_key":"b00","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s00","_type":"span","text":"Forty hours of playback. Adaptive noise cancellation."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b01","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s01","_type":"span","text":"Free shipping on orders over 75 USD, and a 30 day return window if they are not for you."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b02","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s02","_type":"span","text":"Covered by our 24 month limited warranty."}],"style":"normal"}],"owner":"marketing@northwind.example","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"products/aurora"},"summary":"Reference-grade wireless headphones.","title":"Aurora Wireless Headphones"}
{"_id":"page.tide","_type":"contentPage","body":[{"_key":"b00","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s00","_type":"span","text":"IP67 rated. Twelve hour battery."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b01","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s01","_type":"span","text":"Try it for 30 days. If it is not for you, send it back."}],"style":"normal"}],"owner":"marketing@northwind.example","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"products/tide"},"summary":"A speaker that survives the beach.","title":"Tide Portable Speaker"}
{"_id":"page.checkout-terms","_type":"contentPage","body":[{"_key":"b00","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s00","_type":"span","text":"By completing this order you agree to the following terms."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b01","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s01","_type":"span","text":"Returns may be initiated within 30 days of delivery."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b02","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s02","_type":"span","text":"EU customers additionally have a 14 day cooling-off period."}],"style":"normal"}],"owner":"legal@northwind.example","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"checkout-terms"},"summary":"The terms you accept when you place an order.","title":"Checkout Terms"}
{"_id":"page.contact","_type":"contentPage","body":[{"_key":"b00","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s00","_type":"span","text":"Our support team replies within one business day."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b01","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s01","_type":"span","text":"Before you write in: most return questions are answered by our 30 day policy page."}],"style":"normal"}],"owner":"support@northwind.example","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"support/contact"},"summary":"How to reach a human.","title":"Contact Support"}
{"_id":"page.holiday-guide","_type":"contentPage","body":[{"_key":"b00","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s00","_type":"span","text":"Shopping early this year? Here is what to know."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b01","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s01","_type":"span","text":"Every order is covered by a 30 day return window, so you can buy with confidence."}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b02","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"s02","_type":"span","text":"Orders over 75 USD ship free."}],"style":"normal"}],"owner":"marketing@northwind.example","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"blog/holiday-guide"},"summary":"What to buy, and how long you have to change your mind.","title":"Holiday Shopping Guide"}
